How to use
# 1. Update .env — change DATABASE_URL to point at the db service:
#    DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@db:5432/agrivet?schema=public"

# 2. Start everything
docker compose up -d

# 3. Run migrations
docker exec agrivet-api npx prisma migrate deploy
The app runs on port 3000 (configurable via PORT in .env). The uploads/ directory is mounted as a bind volume so uploaded files persist.